eclipse-incident-gungnir-warning = Attention! Gungnir weapon activated. This facility has been designated for liquidation. Impact in 30 seconds. Brace for collision!
eclipse-incident-gungnir-source = Mass scanners have detected an incoming kinetic strike. The source bearing is marked on the scanner; the exact trajectory is unknown.
eclipse-gungnir-radar-source = GUNGNIR: SOURCE
eclipse-incident-gungnir-passage = Gungnir passage confirmed. Structural failure will follow along its trajectory. Take cover!
eclipse-incident-hammer-warning = Hammer artillery battery targeting detected. Ranging impact expected in 30 seconds. Clear the marked area.
eclipse-incident-hammer-ranging = Hammer ranging impact at ({ $x }, { $y }). Red markers indicate subsequent impacts. Salvos are 10 seconds apart.
eclipse-incident-hammer-end = Artillery fire has ceased. Engineering and medical teams should begin recovery operations.
eclipse-incident-damocles-warning = Damocles siege projectile detected. Estimated impact in 65 seconds. Prepare interception measures.
eclipse-incident-damocles-track = Damocles approaching ({ $x }, { $y }). Impact in 60 seconds. Its casing is vulnerable to weapons fire.
eclipse-incident-damocles-intercepted = Damocles signal lost. Interception confirmed.
eclipse-incident-damocles-landed = Warning! Damocles has penetrated the hull. Fuse active: 30 seconds to detonation. Destroy the warhead or tow it away from the station!
eclipse-incident-vessel-warning = Distress signal received from an unidentified vessel. It will shortly enter station radar range.
eclipse-incident-vessel-arrived = Distress vessel located at ({ $x }, { $y }). Crew status unknown. EVA equipment is required for investigation.
eclipse-incident-shift-warning = Docking request received. Warning: sender identification matches your station. Quarantine precautions recommended.
eclipse-incident-shift-arrived = Unknown station fragment detected at ({ $x }, { $y }). Repeating recordings of your shift's communications received. Prevent vegetation from reaching the main facility.
eclipse-incident-zero-warning = Anomalous temperature drop detected. Locate and destroy the crystalline source. It moves toward warmer air.
eclipse-incident-source-location = Initial temperature collapse registered at ({ $x }, { $y }). Isolate compartments and prepare heaters.
eclipse-incident-living-warning = Unknown plant activity detected within station structures. Biological hazard analysis pending. Contain the growth.
eclipse-incident-living-location = Suspected centre of invasive growth at ({ $x }, { $y }). Destroying the root heart will stop its spread.
eclipse-incident-living-classified = Biological analysis complete. Biological hazard level: { $level } of 7. Restrict access to contaminated compartments.
eclipse-incident-living-blob-seed = An unidentified level-five biological nucleus has been detected. Maintain quarantine. Avoid contact and prevent sample dispersal.
eclipse-incident-living-contained = Root source destroyed. Active growth has stopped. Remaining vegetation and mobile organisms require clearance.
eclipse-incident-tide-warning = The station is crossing a Black Tide migration stream. Contact in 30 seconds. Dim external lighting; bright lights attract the swarm.
eclipse-incident-tide-end = The main migration stream has passed. Check lights, external airlocks and remaining organisms.
eclipse-distress-grid = Distress vessel
eclipse-other-shift-grid = Echo of another shift
eclipse-living-floor = overgrown station deck
eclipse-ghost-survivor-name = Distress vessel survivor
eclipse-ghost-survivor-description = You survived an accident aboard a small ship. Wait for rescuers or attract their attention. You are not an antagonist and know nothing about the station's current events.
eclipse-ghost-echo-name = Survivor of the other shift
eclipse-ghost-echo-description = You awoke amongst roots on a station fragment. The nearby station's name feels familiar. Seek help and warn rescuers about the root heart. You are not an antagonist; memories of the disaster are fragmented.
